# Git Commit Messages

Use Conventional Commits: `type(scope): description`

- `feat:` new feature
- `fix:` bug fix
- `docs:` documentation
- `style:` formatting
- `refactor:` code restructuring
- `test:` tests
- `chore:` maintenance

Example: `feat(storage): add local storage adapter`
